From 00a708f2d3f5bcc9630d22db3fddf1b486d9a469 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:55:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: weapon enchants - spells and items cast at our weapon
 (Rockbiter now; stones/oils) (F-219)

- interact: target kind "weapon"/"offhand" (CMSG_CAST_SPELL / CMSG_USE_ITEM with TARGET_FLAG_ITEM
  0x10 + the equipped item's packed guid); inventory reports each item's temporary enchant
  (ITEM_FIELD_ENCHANTMENT_1_1 = OBJECT_END + 0x10, TEMP_ENCHANTMENT_SLOT 1)
- combat: Ability.on_weapon casts at the main hand only while it carries no temporary enchant
- runner: Rockbiter back as on_weapon; weapon_consumable() puts a stone/oil (any item whose spell
  is effect 54 ENCHANT_ITEM_TEMPORARY) on a bare main hand before a pull, never retrying a rejected one
Verified live: Azuremyst shaman's main hand 36 carries temp enchant 29 (Rockbiter) after one cast.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
